OL,3,GNEWSAThousands still without power
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo batters Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30,000 homes across Scotland
OL,7,Fremain without power in the aftermath
OL,8,Fof Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FOne man died as the second named storm
OL,11,Fin a matter of days brought heavy
OL,12,Fflooding and wind gusts in some areas
OL,13,Fof up to 85mph (137km/h).
OL,15,FDespite widespread travel disruption
OL,16,Facross the weekend Network Rail said
OL,17,Fmost services had been restored to full
OL,18,Foperation after an amber weather
OL,19,Fwarning ended at 21:00 on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
